WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.006
Your whole library on one screen: who is in, what is due and what needs attention.

00:00:06.106 --> 00:00:12.013
The seat map shows every seat, shift by shift, and which are free.

00:00:12.113 --> 00:00:18.026
Set your fee plans once, for example Monthly for 30 days.

00:00:18.126 --> 00:00:24.339
Students join with your Library ID. You choose a seat, shift and plan, then approve.

00:00:24.439 --> 00:00:30.343
Every student, their membership and what they owe, in one list.

00:00:30.443 --> 00:00:36.354
Record cash or UPI fees. The receipt shows up in the student's app.

00:00:36.454 --> 00:00:42.369
See who is in the library today. Students punch in only from inside.

00:00:42.469 --> 00:00:48.377
Monthly reports show income, expenses and profit.

00:00:48.477 --> 00:00:55.065
Owners sign in with a password plus an authenticator code. Keep your recovery codes safe.
